Third-party components keep their own licences. See docs/CREDITS.md for the
full list; in summary:

  lib/victron/tiny_aes.*        derived from kokke/tiny-AES-c (The Unlicense,
                                public domain)
  lib/guition/fonts/*.h         Adafruit GFX bitmap fonts, converted from GNU
                                FreeFont (GPL with the font exception, which
                                permits embedding in a document or program
                                without affecting that work's licence)

Libraries linked at build time (NimBLE-Arduino, AsyncTCP, ESPAsyncWebServer,
Arduino_GFX, ArduinoJson, the Bosch BME68x driver, arduino-esp32/ESP-IDF) are
fetched by PlatformIO and are not redistributed in this repository, except
inside the prebuilt images under releases/, which therefore also carry the
terms of those libraries (all permissive: MIT, Apache-2.0, BSD-3).
